        ],
        "id": "R2",
        "text": "If the history item has no download ID and is a Grabbed item, a failure is published for just that item's episode."
      },
      {
        "cites": [
          "Sonarr.Core|M:NzbDrone.Core.Download.FailedDownloadService.MarkAsFailed(System.Int32,System.String,System.String,System.Boolean)"
        ],
        "id": "R3",
        "text": "If the history item has no download ID and is not Grabbed, the call fails with \"Unable to mark download as failed, history item was not grabbed and has no download ID\"."
