        "id": "R4",
        "text": "If there is a download ID, the Grabbed history items with that ID are gathered (the given item first if Grabbed, then others newest first), de-duplicated by id, and the first one is used for the failure event with all their distinct episode ids."
      },
      {
        "cites": [
